
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #fff0f0;
            font-family: "Comic Sans MS", cursive, sans-serif;
            color: #8b0000;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #b22222;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 35px 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 21px;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 35px auto;
            padding: 30px;
            background-color: white;
            border: 3px solid #e57373;
            border-radius: 18px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #b22222;
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        main p {
            font-size: 22px;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        .highlight {
            color: #c62828;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #b22222;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header h1 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }

            main {
                margin: 15px;
                padding: 20px;
            }

            main p {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</h1>
        <p>Discovering the technology shaping our future!</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <h2>About This Course</h2>

        <p>
            Introduction to Artificial Intelligence is a trimester course
            in which students discover what artificial intelligence (AI) is,
            how it is currently used, and how it could be used in the future.
            Students will learn about machine learning, deep learning, and
            neural networks and how these technologies already influence
            decisions in everyday life. They will explore the history of AI,
            its current applications, and its many possible uses in the future
            while considering the questions and concerns surrounding this
            growing technology. Through hands-on activities, students will
            experiment with different AI applications and try basic programming
            of an artificially intelligent system.
        </p>

        <h2>What Will We Learn?</h2>

        <p>
            Students will explore how AI works, experiment with AI tools,
            discover real-world applications, and learn how artificial
            intelligence could shape the future. They will also discuss
            the benefits, limitations, and responsible use of AI.
        </p>
    </main>

    <footer>
        Introduction to Artificial Intelligence | Learning About the Future
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
